#: commands\aircraft.py:504
msgid "**Distance:** {distance} nautical miles\n"
"**Direction:** {direction}° from your location"
msgstr "**Afstand:** {distance} zeemijl\n"
"**Richting:** {direction}° vanaf uw locatie"

